<heading>grants account show - Show permissions for an account.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  show NAME
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Lists all permissions granted to an account, both directly and
through group memberships.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
show admin
  Show all permissions for the admin account.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
account/add, account/remove, group/show, path/show
</paragraph>
